{"slug":"newt-gingrich","qid":"Q182788","name":"Newt Gingrich","desc":"American politician and former speaker of the United States House of Representatives","article":"Newt Gingrich","born":"1943-06-17","died":null,"birthplace":"Harrisburg","parties":["Republican Party"],"offices":[{"t":"Speaker of the House","w":"","f":1995,"u":1999},{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"GA-06","f":1979,"u":1999}],"summary":"Newton Leroy Gingrich (; né McPherson; born June 17, 1943) is an American politician who served as the 50th speaker of the United States House of Representatives from 1995 to 1999. A member of the Republican Party, he was the U.S. representative for Georgia's 6th congressional district serving north Atlanta and nearby areas from 1979 until his resignation in 1999. In 2012, Gingrich unsuccessfully ran for the Republican nomination for president of the United States.","photo":null,"history":[{"y":1998,"o":"H","k":"GA-06","p":"R","v":164966,"s":70.7,"w":true,"n":"Newt Gingrich"},{"y":1996,"o":"H","k":"GA-06","p":"R","v":174155,"s":57.8,"w":true,"n":"Newt Gingrich"},{"y":1994,"o":"H","k":"GA-06","p":"R","v":119432,"s":64.17,"w":true,"n":"Newt Gingrich"},{"y":1992,"o":"H","k":"GA-06","p":"R","v":158761,"s":57.74,"w":true,"n":"Newt Gingrich"},{"y":1990,"o":"H","k":"GA-06","p":"R","v":78768,"s":50.31,"w":true,"n":"Newt Gingrich"},{"y":1988,"o":"H","k":"GA-06","p":"R","v":110169,"s":58.91,"w":true,"n":"Newt Gingrich"},{"y":1986,"o":"H","k":"GA-06","p":"R","v":75583,"s":59.54,"w":true,"n":"Newt Gingrich"},{"y":1984,"o":"H","k":"GA-06","p":"R","v":116655,"s":69.14,"w":true,"n":"Newt Gingrich"},{"y":1982,"o":"H","k":"GA-06","p":"R","v":62352,"s":55.27,"w":true,"n":"Newt Gingrich"},{"y":1980,"o":"H","k":"GA-06","p":"R","v":96071,"s":59.05,"w":true,"n":"Newt Gingrich"},{"y":1978,"o":"H","k":"GA-06","p":"R","v":47078,"s":54.4,"w":true,"n":"Newton Leroy Gingrich"},{"y":1976,"o":"H","k":"GA-06","p":"R","v":72400,"s":48.28,"w":false,"n":"Newt Gingrich"}]}